<newsitem itemid="623134" id="root" date="1997-05-29" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Ocean Diamond Mining lifts year earnings.</title>
<headline>Ocean Diamond Mining lifts year earnings.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		 (millions of rand unless indicated)</p>
<p>    Headline shr (cts)  33.0   vs  16.0</p>
<p>Attrib income</p>
<p>    before pref div     12.52  vs   6.28</p>
<p>    Pref div		 0.45  vs   0.45</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		 12.58  vs   6.34</p>
<p>    Tax			0.06  vs   0.06</p>
<p>    Interest received    4.79  vs   2.24</p>
<p>    Turnover		43.97  vs  38.06</p>
<p>Pref div payable June 30</p>
<p>On register June 13</p>
<p>Full name: Ocean Diamond Mining Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE: The group said that it had identified the potential of new diamond projects, particularly in Angola. It expected that operations in the year to come would continue at similar levels to those in the past year although some exciting new projects, if viable, would be added to its portfolio.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
</text>
